 東方妖恋談","showTelopOverlay":false,"seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_007_パチュリー・ノーレッジ.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":4.5},{"id":"F6C2D01A-B5F7-4C42-B2A9-EA2861F12683","telop":"彼女がそう言いながら、僕を庇い、再び攻撃を受ける。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第29話\/やられ怒り.png","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":5.804988662131519,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第8スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第29話_a4a4484fdd\/元女子校の日常　第29話_a4a4484fdd.008.jpeg","backgroundName":"単色背景","title":"シーン 8","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","showTelopOverlay":false,"seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_008_操夢.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":3.5},{"id":"860AD236-73E7-4825-B903-BEA8624A23B0","telop":"するとまた血が飛び散り、今度はその相手の姿が一瞬見える。\n「えっ…」そして、ある姿と重なる。「魔理沙さん…」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第29話\/やられ怒り.png","characterName":"操夢","transitionName":"なし","animationName":"なし","voiceDuration":6.921292517006803,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"slideTitle":"第9スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第29話_a4a4484fdd\/元女子校の日常　第29話_a4a4484fdd.009.jpeg","backgroundName":"単色背景","title":"シーン 9","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","showTelopOverlay":false,"seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_009_操夢.wav","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"duration":5.300000000000001},{"id":